This project is derived from TvBoxHarmony:
https://github.com/yuppiesnotzhuhao/TvBoxHarmony

The upstream HarmonyOS ArkTS implementation is distributed under the
Apache License 2.0. The upstream LICENSE file is retained in this repository.

Changes in this repository include:
- Application identity and display name changed to cc-box-HarmonyOS / 丛丛影视.
- Added a bundled source configuration derived from the cc-tv-box Android
  project's app/src/main/assets/congcong_sources.json.
- Replaced Android loopback proxy URLs with direct CMS API URLs where the
  Android configuration contained an explicit source URL.
- Added an ArkTS Guazi source adapter based on the protocol implementation in
  the cc-tv-box Android project's GuaziApi, GuaziCrypto and GuaziAdapter.
- Jianpian is intentionally excluded at the user's direction.

HarmonyOS runtime behavior and HAP build/signing must be verified by the
repository's GitHub Actions workflow and on a HarmonyOS device.
